Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.15,0:00:08.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Does this mean it's a peaceful world now?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.07,0:00:15.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, you're awake already!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.16,0:00:16.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Morning, big brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.82,0:00:18.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kotori! You're all right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.49,0:00:22.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What about Fraxinus? Is the whole crew okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.33,0:00:25.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you still half-asleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.21,0:00:28.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Uh, um... What day is it today?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.84,0:00:31.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? What else but November 3rd?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.13,0:00:33.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If it's November 3rd, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.55,0:00:37.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's the day after Origami went Inverse.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.55,0:00:40.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank goodness. For real...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.89,0:00:42.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.39,0:00:46.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I managed to change the world after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.03,0:00:57.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daily life. An illusion which lasts forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.61,0:01:01.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What will be illuminated by\Nthe light which was reclaimed?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.04,0:02:33.96,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,"Episode Ten:\N'Another World, Another Girl'"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.04,0:02:32.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You came, Shido! Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.33,0:02:35.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Morning. Sorry to make you wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.38,0:02:37.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here, don't freak out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.30,0:02:38.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's one of your favorites.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.92,0:02:42.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ooh! You made bite-size\Ncutlets for me today, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.14,0:02:48.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--Huh?\N--Hmm? Isn't that what you said\Nyou'd make yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.10,0:02:49.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.98,0:02:55.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, that's right! Sorry, but I\Nkinda ran out of ingredients.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.11,0:02:57.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I made you a rice bowl today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.19,0:02:58.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,With sweet eggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.94,0:03:02.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,M-My word! That sounds the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.49,0:03:07.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--Ooh! I just ate breakfast, but I'm\Nfeeling hungry just thinking about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.74,0:03:07.49,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,--Does this world have\Na history I'm not aware of?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.54,0:03:10.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What a nice morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.25,0:03:12.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good on you to pick me up, servant.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.50,0:03:14.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bow. Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.67,0:03:16.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido. Tohka. Kotori.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.96,0:03:19.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yeah. Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.34,0:03:22.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's up with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.84,0:03:27.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,For a second there, your eyes were\Nlingering on Yuzuru and my breasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.06,0:03:31.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Explanation. That's a perfectly\Nnormal reaction for a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.48,0:03:32.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Care to comment, Shido?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.98,0:03:34.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,N-No, I wasn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.94,0:03:43.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami hasn't come yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.70,0:03:48.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.08,0:03:52.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,For one reason or another,\Nsomething seems incomplete.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.12,0:03:53.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's a weird feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.00,0:03:55.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Incomplete?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.29,0:03:58.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.21,0:04:00.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Suzuhara?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.51,0:04:01.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.55,0:04:02.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Setouchi?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.68,0:04:03.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--Here.\N--Is she absent today?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.68,0:04:04.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--Takizawa?\N--Is she absent today?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.72,0:04:05.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--Here.\N--Or maybe she's just late?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.72,0:04:06.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--Tsukui?\N--Or maybe she's just late?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.64,0:04:07.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--Here!\N--Or maybe she's just late?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.51,0:04:09.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Next is Tonomachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.06,0:04:10.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here, here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.39,0:04:13.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hiroto Tonomachi is doing\Nwonderful again today, my honey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.27,0:04:16.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Marking Tonomachi as present.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.52,0:04:18.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Next is Nakahara!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.36,0:04:19.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.48,0:04:22.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hmm? Did I say something odd?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.07,0:04:24.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Uh, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.03,0:04:27.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,After Tonomachi should be...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.32,0:04:29.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ms. Okamine, what about Origami?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.16,0:04:31.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.66,0:04:34.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who might that be, may I ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.38,0:04:38.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami? Is that supposed to be a name?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.34,0:04:42.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Did Itsuka fold a bunch of\Npaper cranes for the teacher?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.72,0:04:46.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wha?! He's trying to complete\Nthe Tammie route now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.39,0:04:47.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's so lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.14,0:04:49.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--Nishikubo?\N--I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.60,0:04:51.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--Here\N--Negishi?\N--I guess in this world, Origami doesn't live in this city.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.60,0:04:52.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--Here.\N--I guess in this world,\NOrigami doesn't live in this city.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.35,0:04:53.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--Nonohara?\N--I guess in this world,\NOrigami doesn't live in this city.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.43,0:04:54.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--Here.\N--I guess in this world,\NOrigami doesn't live in this city.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.89,0:04:59.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The Origami of this world doesn't\Nhold a grudge against Spirits...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.02,0:05:01.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...and lives happily with her parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.69,0:05:06.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's better this way.\NThis is how the world should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.45,0:05:07.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.20,0:05:09.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's up, Tohka?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.16,0:05:13.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong? Are you in pain?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.41,0:05:14.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.96,0:05:20.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.55,0:05:23.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's better like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.67,0:05:27.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Though, I'd have liked \Nto see her just once...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.05,0:05:31.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The Origami of this world, smiling...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.10,0:05:41.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's the matter with Shido?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.73,0:05:43.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, he seems in the dumps.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.86,0:05:46.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If he's that zoned out, it's a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.74,0:05:49.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wha--?! What do you mean by that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.28,0:05:52.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I might be wrong. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.08,0:05:54.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you know something, out with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.08,0:05:57.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-When it comes to the\Ntroubles of high school boys,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.33,0:05:59.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,it's almost always about girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.46,0:06:02.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Girls spreading weird rumors...\NTreating them cruelly...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.67,0:06:05.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Guys worry about those sorts of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.46,0:06:07.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really? Is that how it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.97,0:06:11.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. And when you ask\Nto group up for a project.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.39,0:06:14.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They say "Eww" in a disgusted tone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.10,0:06:17.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Or when you pick up their eraser,\Nthey say "I don't want it anymore. Keep it."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.69,0:06:20.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,H-Hold your horses!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.44,0:06:24.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How does a Spirit like you know\Nso much about student life?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.19,0:06:29.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, I think it's obvious that\Nsomething happened to him at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.32,0:06:32.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He'll probably be fine if we\Ngive him some time, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.74,0:06:38.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But, it's tough seeing Shido acting so down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.33,0:06:40.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can't we do something for him?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.25,0:06:41.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know what to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.38,0:06:48.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If it's girl trouble giving him grief,\Nit'll take a girl to heal his heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.97,0:06:52.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.35,0:06:54.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've gotta focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.89,0:06:57.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sh-Shido, I'll help.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.06,0:06:59.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.39,0:07:00.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then why don't you--
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.48,0:07:04.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What kinda outfit is that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.52,0:07:06.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And what's with those bodies?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.32,0:07:08.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,W-What's it matter to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.11,0:07:13.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's right. What's important\Nis to let us help you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.78,0:07:15.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-Wh-Wh-Wha--?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.54,0:07:18.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Natsumi! Is this your doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.42,0:07:25.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait a damn second!\NWhy aren't you in a swimsuit?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.13,0:07:27.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We agreed to do this together!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.76,0:07:29.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, but well...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.09,0:07:32.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,When I thought about it, wearing that\Nwould be way too embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.84,0:07:35.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'd feel so stupid, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.22,0:07:37.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're the one who gave us\Nthese stupid outfits!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.97,0:07:39.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--You little...! We'll \Nmake you wear one, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.93,0:07:40.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--Kotori, calm down!\N--You little...! We'll make you wear one, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.56,0:07:44.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ahh, I'm being violated!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.31,0:07:47.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Would you all just...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.79,0:08:02.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You guys are killing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.67,0:08:04.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hmph. Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.96,0:08:06.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry, Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.88,0:08:07.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.05,0:08:10.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nah, sorry to worry you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.38,0:08:14.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks. I'm better now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.68,0:08:19.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't intend to pry or anything,\Nbut get a hold of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.68,0:08:22.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You never know when\Nanother Spirit will appear.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.19,0:08:23.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.40,0:08:28.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's Spirits we don't know about,\Nnot to mention Kurumi and Devil are out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.15,0:08:31.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Devil? What's that Spirit?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.99,0:08:35.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you talking about?\NThe Spirit Hunter "Devil."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.07,0:08:40.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Compared to "Nightmare" Kurumi Tokisaki,\Nshe's every bit as dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.91,0:08:42.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,As much as Kurumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.75,0:08:46.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you for real? What's with you today?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.38,0:08:49.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's like you forgot everything\Nup until yesterday!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.96,0:08:52.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Would you mind explaining again?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.34,0:08:54.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,About this Spirit named "Devil."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.05,0:08:59.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Devil. We've confirmed she exists, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.56,0:09:03.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's an unidentified Spirit who's\Nevaded all attempts of contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.81,0:09:08.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Also, and quite likely in fact,\Nshe's an Inverse.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.65,0:09:10.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.19,0:09:13.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,An Inverse Spirit just \Nshowing up like normal?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.69,0:09:17.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm trying to tell you,\Nwe don't know a whole lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.03,0:09:19.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What did you mean by "Spirit Hunter"?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.83,0:09:23.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just like it sounds.\NDevil never appears on her own.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.54,0:09:28.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's only when some other\NSpirit happens to manifests...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.04,0:09:30.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...that she appears and attacks them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.79,0:09:35.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If Tohka and the others hadn't helped,\NNatsumi would've been in big trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.34,0:09:38.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is... Devil?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.68,0:09:39.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.35,0:09:41.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.65,0:09:52.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido, are you still sleepy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.40,0:09:56.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine. Just didn't get \Nmuch sleep last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.70,0:09:57.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.45,0:10:02.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.37,0:10:05.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami wasn't in her apartment...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.79,0:10:09.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...nor at the house she\Nlived in with her parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.38,0:10:11.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why did she become a Spirit?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.38,0:10:13.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why an Inverse?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.21,0:10:19.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,By changing history five years back,\NI should've saved her parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.55,0:10:21.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.60,0:10:23.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go all out today!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.60,0:10:27.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What could've happened in this\Nworld in that five-year span?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.48,0:10:29.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, before I forget!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.48,0:10:31.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't do much alone...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.23,0:10:35.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If I explain what I know,\NRatatoskr might look into it...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.19,0:10:40.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Today I have a new friend\Nto introduce to you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.24,0:10:41.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on in please!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.78,0:10:44.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--Whoa, check her out.\N--Wonder what she's like?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.79,0:10:47.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's so pretty...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.87,0:10:48.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.25,0:10:51.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Origami Tobiichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.21,0:10:53.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nice to meet you, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.79,0:10:57.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That dazzling long hair\Nand pure, innocent smile!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.30,0:11:00.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Cute enough to give my honey\Na run for her money!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.59,0:11:04.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's see... The seat next to Itsuka is open.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.35,0:11:05.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can sit there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.97,0:11:07.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.52,0:11:11.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.56,0:11:12.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.81,0:11:14.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.11,0:11:20.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What do you mean? What makes you think\NDevil transferred to your school?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.41,0:11:23.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll explain later once I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.78,0:11:26.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But it's true. Please believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.66,0:11:30.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, but I'm not thoroughly convinced.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.29,0:11:31.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kotori...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.54,0:11:33.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll have Ratatoskr investigate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.96,0:11:35.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's the student's name?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.96,0:11:38.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami. Origami Tobiichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.88,0:11:43.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hold on... Origami Tobiichi from the AST?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.22,0:11:46.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What? You actually remember\Nthe last world now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.64,0:11:49.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.27,0:11:52.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's fought against Tohka\Nand the others a bunch of times.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.52,0:11:54.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But she retired not too long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.23,0:11:56.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now that you mention it,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.65,0:12:02.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami Tobiichi left the AST around\Nthe time Devil first started appearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.78,0:12:06.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why did Origami join the AST\Nif I saved her parents?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.74,0:12:08.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you even listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.83,0:12:12.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, sorry. Tell me if you find anything out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.54,0:12:20.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If I changed what happened five\Nyears ago, why is this Origami...?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.51,0:12:24.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I might just have to ask her in person...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.14,0:12:35.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um, what's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.81,0:12:37.82,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,"I want to talk with you.\NCome to the roof during lunch.\NItsuka"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.15,0:12:37.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You wanted to talk with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.19,0:12:41.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, sorry if this seems sudden, Origami.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.40,0:12:42.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.32,0:12:44.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oops, sorry! I mean Tobiichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.49,0:12:47.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's kinda rude of me to call you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.20,0:12:51.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, I just wasn't expecting it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.08,0:12:53.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um, Itsuka...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.17,0:12:56.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's this about?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.92,0:13:01.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tobiichi... Didn't you say something\Nwhen you saw me this morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.67,0:13:04.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh! Sorry if that's been bothering you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.72,0:13:06.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I was a little surprised...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.80,0:13:10.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You look exactly like someone\NI met a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.97,0:13:11.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.64,0:13:14.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You mean, could we have...?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.31,0:13:17.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, that's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.27,0:13:20.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The person I met was\Nback some five years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.90,0:13:23.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You would've been in elementary school.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.53,0:13:24.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Besides...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.82,0:13:29.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That person passed away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.49,0:13:31.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Five years ago, right before my eyes...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.95,0:13:32.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.00,0:13:34.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Back then...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.87,0:13:38.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,May I go back to class now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.50,0:13:40.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Uh, wait. Hold on a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.88,0:13:43.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Five years ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.51,0:13:46.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You mean during the Nankou area fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.13,0:13:48.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How did you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.39,0:13:51.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Could that have been your big brother I saw?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.10,0:13:55.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.02,0:14:00.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tobiichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.82,0:14:06.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Your brother was the one\Nwho saved both of my parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.07,0:14:11.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If he hadn't been there,\Nboth of them would've died for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.91,0:14:13.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm forever grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.87,0:14:15.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.83,0:14:21.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,In other words, I was able to\Nsave Origami's parents after all...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.84,0:14:24.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry for blurting that out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.59,0:14:26.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.76,0:14:29.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so thankful for what he did that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.34,0:14:34.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Unfortunately, my parents died\Nin a car accident four years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.60,0:14:38.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But thanks to your big brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.77,0:14:43.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,for that year they were alive,\Nmy dad and mom gave me so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.48,0:14:45.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.24,0:14:48.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is that fate at work?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.99,0:14:50.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Itsuka?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.24,0:14:50.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.24,0:14:53.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then, why did you join the AST?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.24,0:14:55.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If your parents survived...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.33,0:14:58.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How do you know about that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.21,0:15:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Uh, um... Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.67,0:15:06.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't tell me you went outside\Nduring a spatial quake alarm!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.01,0:15:08.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Uh, yeah. Actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.67,0:15:11.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's very dangerous! You have to evacuate!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.84,0:15:13.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,R-Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.18,0:15:18.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You want to know the reason I joined the AST?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.31,0:15:22.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. If you don't mind telling me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.11,0:15:26.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Itsuka, you knowing about the AST means...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.44,0:15:29.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...you know the reason for the alarms.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.70,0:15:30.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.20,0:15:36.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,During the fire five years ago,\Nit was a Spirit that killed your big brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.24,0:15:37.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.95,0:15:39.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I thought to myself...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.50,0:15:42.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...I didn't want more victims\Nlike him to be made.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.21,0:15:47.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wanted to become a person who\Ncould protect others from Spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.76,0:15:52.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's because of what I did then...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.93,0:15:57.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can I ask one more thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.52,0:15:59.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.10,0:16:03.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why did you... become a Spirit?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.69,0:16:06.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.98,0:16:09.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's this mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.74,0:16:11.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That had to be...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.03,0:16:13.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Lunch time is over, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.86,0:16:17.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you. I'm glad we had this talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.37,0:16:21.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait! Can't we talk some more?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.37,0:16:23.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But class is about to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.46,0:16:24.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Some other day is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.13,0:16:27.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you're free sometime, can I see you again?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.96,0:16:30.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Are you asking if...?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.34,0:16:32.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Eh?! U-Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.22,0:16:36.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Could I have some time to think about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.89,0:16:38.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Uh, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.68,0:16:41.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.73,0:16:46.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What a strange feeling it is...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.90,0:16:50.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Am I too used to how Origami was before?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.78,0:16:57.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido, where did you go during lunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.62,0:17:01.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I got a call from Kotori.\NShe's fine with curry for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.91,0:17:05.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ooh, that's great! I can't wait for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.22,0:17:17.34,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,"I'm free this Saturday.\NTobiichi"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.72,0:17:17.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Saturday, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.93,0:17:21.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll have to talk with Ratatoskr.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.98,0:17:30.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Man, I'm tired. I'll just rest for a bit...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.62,0:17:43.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.50,0:17:48.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Big boys should watch\Nwhere they sleep, dear Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.25,0:17:51.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Whoa! K-Kurumi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.42,0:17:55.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good evening, Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.84,0:17:58.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Such a cute sleeping face you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.31,0:18:06.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My goodness. I'm deeply hurt\Nthat you fear me so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.98,0:18:11.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I thought we were comrades\Nwho changed the world together.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.69,0:18:13.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kurumi, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.19,0:18:16.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, I remember everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.03,0:18:20.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,About the original world. About Origami, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.82,0:18:21.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.49,0:18:25.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why did things end up this way?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.12,0:18:27.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What happened to Origami?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.12,0:18:30.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's something even I'm not aware of.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.54,0:18:31.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.25,0:18:36.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,With Origami as she is now,\Nthere are certain ways to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.13,0:18:38.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.47,0:18:39.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.27,0:18:52.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come now, don't be so afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.48,0:18:57.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If I just shoot Yod at Origami,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.19,0:19:02.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be able to see what sort of life\Nshe lived out in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.87,0:19:04.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yod...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.24,0:19:05.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.75,0:19:09.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But in that case,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.25,0:19:13.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,why didn't you use Yod on Origami\Nwhen she went Inverse?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.42,0:19:18.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My goodness. You think\NI could get close to her then?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.09,0:19:23.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A-Anyways, we can find out why\Nshe inversed in this world, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.93,0:19:25.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please, I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.73,0:19:29.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Whatever shall I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.98,0:19:32.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Where could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.69,0:19:35.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How could I lose my hair clip like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.23,0:19:37.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What if...?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.45,0:19:41.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I knew it! This is where it was!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.78,0:19:45.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank goodness! I need to be careful...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.24,0:19:46.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.37,0:19:48.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But in that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.20,0:19:51.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is that Itsuka's voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.83,0:19:56.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Itsuka and...?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.10,0:20:15.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Origami?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.19,0:20:22.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Uh, you see... I can explain...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.66,0:20:26.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.66,0:20:28.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.95,0:20:33.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Since we're in this world now,\Ndo I say "Nice to meet you?"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.75,0:20:39.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Though, it is quite possible we've\Nalready ran into each other before.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.42,0:20:41.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Spir... it...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.40,0:21:02.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Spirit armor?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.86,0:21:05.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I knew you had to be Devil!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.45,0:21:06.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Satan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.54,0:21:17.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wouldn't you say that's a pretty\Nviolent way to greet someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.97,0:21:25.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,K-Kurumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.31,0:21:33.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,O-Origami, how could you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.65,0:21:45.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's the meaning of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.53,0:21:48.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.45,0:21:51.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Itsuka?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.21,0:21:58.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing in a place like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.29,0:22:00.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.30,0:22:03.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.31,0:23:41.50,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,"Episode Eleven:\N'Angel of the Starry Night'"
